<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE - Taib lifts H1 97 net profit 10 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Taib lifts H1 97 net profit 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p> Net profit		  5.3   vs    4.8</p>
<p> Operating income	 14.6   vs   11.3</p>
<p> Expenses		    6.2   vs    5.3</p>
<p> Net interest income     3.5   vs    4.0</p>
<p> Fees and other income  11.1   vs    7.4</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   112.4   vs  107.9</p>
<p> Assets		    302.2   vs  278.3</p>
<p>Full Name: Taib Bank E.C.</p>
<p>Note - Chief Executive Officer Iqbal Mamdani said: &quot;Our results reflect the success of the bank's ongoing strategy of focusing on fee-based merchant, treasury and investment banking activity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
